# Original Gateway first-room actions, independently reproduced by native
# command traces. No third-party walkthrough text is bundled here.
# Replay starts after the launcher's splash screens and an initial LOOK.
COMMAND open drawer
COMMAND look
COMMAND take book
ASSERT_LOCATION 123 d3
LABEL book_taken
COMMAND inventory
COMMAND drop book
ASSERT_LOCATION 123 ee
LABEL book_dropped
COMMAND close drawer
COMMAND look
ASSERT_LOCATION 123 ee
LABEL opening_complete
